MACRO PREF                                                                      
   &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0                                W    80 A                  
*                                 INVOICE LINE TO IMPORTER                      
*                                 RECORD TYPE RIO                               
     &PREF.RIO-IDPTYP &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0                   3 A                  
*                                 RECORD TYPE                                   
     &PREF.RIO-IDORDNR &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0           +3     7 N                  
*                                 ORDER NUMBER        IDORDNR-002               
     &PREF.RIO-IDARTNR &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0          +10     9 N                  
*                                 PART NUMBER                                   
     &PREF.RIO-REKSIFFR &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +19     1 N                  
*                                 PART NO CHECK DIGIT                           
     &PREF.RIO-BERADREF &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +20    10 A                  
*                                 CUSTOMERS ITEM REF.                           
     &PREF.RIO-KVBEART &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0          +30     6 N                  
*                                 ORDERED QUANTITY                              
     &PREF.RIO-KVLEVART &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +36     6 N                  
*                                 DELIVERED QUANTITY                            
     &PREF.RIO-RESERVG &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0          +42     5 N  2               
*                                 PERCENT SERVICE DEGREE                        
     &PREF.RIO-PRARTBTO-EXP &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0     +47     9 N  2               
*                                 GROSS-PRICE   EXPORT                          
*                                  (FOB-GROSS)                                  
     &PREF.RIO-PRARTNTO &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +56     9 N  2               
*                                 NET PRICE EACH   (FOB NET)                    
     &PREF.RIO-IDFKNGRP &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +65     4 N                  
*                                 FUNCTION GROUP                                
     &PREF.RIO-KDPRODSL &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +69     2 N                  
*                                 TYPE OF ASSORTMENT                            
     &PREF.RIO-KDDSP &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0            +71     1 N                  
*                                 AFFECT ON DSP                                 
     &PREF.RIO-KDVVKL &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0           +72     1 N                  
*                                 VOLUME VALUE CLASS                            
     &PREF.RIO-KDVRINFO &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +73     1 N                  
*                                 VR/DSP UP-DATE                                
     &PREF.RIO-FLINVEST &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +74     1 A                  
*                                 EXCHANGE INVESTMENT FLAG                      
     &PREF.RIO-FLPRTILL &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +75     1 A                  
*                                 PRICE PENALTY FLAG                            
     &PREF.RIO-FLDIRLEV &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0         +76     1 A                  
*                                 DIRECT DELIVERY ?                             
     &PREF.FILLER01 &PREF.RIO-W461RIO0             +77     3 A                  
*** END COPY W461RIO0                LENGTH =       80                          
